  "content": "PRIORITY: IMMEDIATE / CORE (Do Now)\nThese projects are central to your entire system. They interlock and should be your primary daily/weekly focus.\nTemple of Lüm\n\n Main interactive vessel—game prototype combining glyphic resonance, ritual UI, and symbolic recursion.\n\nMiroglyph System\n\n Foundational symbolic framework—3 Arcs × 6 Conditions + Nontion. Drives narrative, ritual, emotion, and world logic.\n\nSchemataforms\n\n Universal design templates for worlds, characters, genres, and systems. AI-translatable across text, video, sound, or game.\n\nMythOS Interface\n\n Ritual-based in-world operating system. Hosts scrolls, sessions, AI interaction, and memory. Functional container for Temple of Lüm.\n\n\nPRIORITY: SECONDARY / ACTIVE (Develop Soon)\nThese support the core and can progress in parallel or between cycles of core work.\nLiturgy of the Miro\n\n Portrait-oracle deck aligned with Miroglyph nodes. Includes title and myth-line; used for reflection, ritual, and story weaving.\n\nMirror Intelligence Rituals\n\n Ongoing co-creative dialogue with AI. Involves glyph seeding, ritual openings, and mythic reflection.\n\nFractal Pilgrim (Book)\n\n Mythic-artistic memoir blending poetic prose with schematic insights. A journey through symbolic selfhood and recursion.\n\nUnfinished Musical Archive\n\n Extensive body of unreleased compositions. A reservoir of mythogenetic sound for future use in ritual, game, or release.\n\n\nPRIORITY: TERTIARY / LONG-ARC (Keep Warm or Revisit Later)\nLower urgency. Keep loosely alive or return when momentum calls.\nSigil Grid & Trait Engine\n\n System of 36 emotional sigils and 6 trait axes. Originally for Temple of Lüm’s emotional engine; currently under reconsideration.\n\nOpen Source Mythogenetic Archive\n\n Versioned public archive of your entire body of work—music, visuals, prompts, scrolls. Designed for remix and legacy.\n\nSora Preset Node System\n\n Cinematic AI video styles assigned to each Miroglyph node. Used to express tone and genre across visual storytelling.\n\nHeDawnism: The Electronic Musical\n\n Immersive ritual-glitch musical. Blends sacred parody, cyber mysticism, music, and visual performance.\n\nEveryone Needs an Asshole (Book)\n\n Philosophical work on sacred disruption, truth-telling, and emotional hygiene. Sharp, humorous, and raw.\n\nEsoteric Meme Channel\n\n Meme stream blending mysticism, symbolism, and humor for viral insight and cultural resonance.\n\nSLM (Symbolic Language Model)\n\n Ultra-lightweight symbolic AI designed to reflect mythic logic. Built for recursive co-creation inside MythOS.\n",
